ed. We are a team of five engineers supporting more than 30 UK businesses, from two-user teams to organisations of 150+ users. WhizzIT is Cyber Essentials certified and a Microsoft Cloud Solution Provider, so our security fundamentals are independently assessed rather than simply claimed."},{"k":"u5","type":"u","label":"Link: Back to Managed Cloud Services","default":"/managed-cloud-services/"},{"k":"s6","type":"s","label":"Link text 1","default":"Back to Managed Cloud Services"},{"k":"i7","type":"i","label":"Image 1","default":{"html":"<img src=\"{{ASSETS}}/images/photos/svc-cloud-migration-services-1024.webp\" srcset=\"{{ASSETS}}/images/photos/svc-cloud-migration-services-640.webp 640w, {{ASSETS}}/images/photos/svc-cloud-migration-services-1024.webp 1024w, {{ASSETS}}/images/photos/svc-cloud-migration-services-1600.webp 1600w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1024px) 45vw, 100vw\" alt=\"Engineer checking server racks with a handheld diagnostic tool\" width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"async\">","src":"{{ASSETS}}/images/photos/svc-cloud-migration-services-1024.webp"}},{"k":"s8","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 4","default":"Managed Cloud Services"},{"k":"s9","type":"s","label":"Bold text 1","default":"Cloud Migration"},{"k":"s10","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 5","default":"What’s included"},{"k":"s11","type":"s","label":"List item 1","default":"Migration planning and readiness assessment"},{"k":"s12","type":"s","label":"List item 2","default":"Microsoft 365 and Google Workspace migrations"},{"k":"s13","type":"s","label":"List item 3","default":"Email, files and identity migration"},{"k":"s14","type":"s","label":"List item 4","default":"Google-to-Microsoft 365 moves"},{"k":"s15","type":"s","label":"List item 5","default":"Data integrity checks and validation"},{"k":"s16","type":"s","label":"List item 6","default":"User communication and support"}]}